      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-19T17:20:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This and `max_order_direct_reclaim` should have similar parameter validation as in arsp/751458:\n\n```\n\tif (align_shift \u003e\u003d BITS_PER_LONG) {\n\t\tpr_err(\"invalid align_shift\u003d%u (must be \u003c %u)\\n\",\n\t\t       align_shift, BITS_PER_LONG);\n\t\treturn -EINVAL;\n\t}\n```",
      "revId": "586bea012620d9309c0cdb72e75ce068adec8db0",
