        "id": 1368430
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-19T17:20:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "arsp/751458 is using the same magic `9`:\n\n```\nstatic unsigned int align_shift \u003d 9;\n```\n\nHow closely tied are these values and can/should they use the same definition?",
      "revId": "586bea012620d9309c0cdb72e75ce068adec8db0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "52dd9a87_a6bb7365",
        "filename": "drivers/gpu/drm/ttm/ttm_pool.c",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 818,
