      "writtenOn": "2026-03-23T22:33:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "While I think this will be helpful to start. Personally I think 9 is a reasonable default. I\u0027d still love for us to work with intel to see if we can make vmalloc() non-physicall contiguous allocations work. This would properly solve the problem IMO",
