      },
      "lineNbr": 818,
      "author": {
        "id": 2044797
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-23T23:00:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So question, why do we ever allow direct reclaim then? If this supports non-contiguous allocations what is the advantage of a physically contiguous allocation at all? Direct reclaim will almost certainly degrade performance offsetting any gains we get from the larger physically contiguous allocation",
      "parentUuid": "915afc7b_7a6c4983",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 818,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 818,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "586bea012620d9309c0cdb72e75ce068adec8db0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "3431de02_27ce3d5b",
