      "writtenOn": "2026-03-23T23:42:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There\u0027s some discussion on this upstream RFC [1]. It sounds like using 2MiB huge pages provide a significant performance improvement on amdgpu. Supposedly there are also some functional problems for using lower order pages in some situations. That being said, it\u0027s unclear to me how much this applies to Intel hardware or the xe driver.\n\n[1] https://lists.freedesktop.org/archives/amd-gfx/2025-September/130744.html",
      "parentUuid": "91351d98_f9f0a427",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 818,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 818,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "586bea012620d9309c0cdb72e75ce068adec8db0",
