        "id": 1060234
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-03-23T23:48:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At the very least, `struct xe_ggtt_pt_ops` [1] appears to only operate on PTEs not PMDs. Are there any other page table structures that actually use higher order allocations?\n\n[1] https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/6355550c251f2498dbaa876c13f44d99fff86935/drivers/gpu/drm/xe/xe_ggtt_types.h#72",
      "parentUuid": "3431de02_27ce3d5b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 818,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 818,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "586bea012620d9309c0cdb72e75ce068adec8db0",
